 "what_this_is": "Facts of the three recorded episodes shown on the replay page, read from their episode folders by demo/public_adapter.extract_facts, the same function that reads every new run. demo/run_episode.py compares a new run with these facts. Wall-clock times are left out. In the robot's own fields, source \"model\" names the agent loop's program slot: in these episodes that slot is filled by the demo client, which serves programs written by the team; Nemotron only picked scrub_bowl or ask_help from a text summary in the in_place and moved situations. evaluator holds the simulator-side grading, which the robot never sees."
